                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "236992423",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561198068205262",
                            "num_reviews": 29,
                            "playtime_forever": 147,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 113,
                            "last_played": 1791681840
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This has been a charming experience, from the gorgeous animation style to the relaxing gameplay. I will say that if you're looking for a challenge, you're not going to find it here; I've found little to no difficulty in the enemies or obstacles; the game makes it obvious which jelly bean morphs to use for every scenario; even the finding the hidden treasures and navigating the, I guess they'd be called challenge courses, have been a nonissue. \r\n\r\nAs someone who played the original on NES and had no idea where to go/what to do, I can tell you that's not an issue here - the levels are straight linear.\r\n\r\nSo, if you're an adult gamer just looking for a pretty chill game experience, check this out; maybe wait for a sale, which is what I did. But this strikes me as the perfect kind of game for kids.",
